WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.320
You might know us from the past 12 years,
teaching children all over Lithuania,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.960
and even in Ireland and Chicago, how to solve
problems by building LEGO robots.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:17.520
For the past 12 years we've travelled the world
teaching robotics and improving our programmes.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:23.760
But over time we noticed it's less and less
a problem that kids don't want to learn tech.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:28.640
The further we go, the more we see
a bigger problem:

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:34.160
kids are becoming dependent on technology.
That's how BrainClub was born.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.160
We started teaching healthy relationships
with technology.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.600
Over the past three years AI has become so popular
that robots are no longer the most modern way to learn.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.040
That's why we're launching
a new programme: BrainClub.
